      {
        "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.CfgDialogGroup, Assembly-CSharp",
        "desc": null,
        "textMaxIndex": 0,
        "textGroupId": "502501_1",
        "useFixedDialogGroup": false,
        "fixedDialogGroupId": 0,
        "dialogs": {
          "$type": "System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp]], mscorlib",
          "$values": [
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951457_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "啊，我不慎把茶具弄碎了，\n而且突然不见了咳嚯……？\n{A惊讶}这是！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951457_content",
                "value": "啊，我不慎把茶具弄碎了，\n而且突然不见了咳嚯……？\n{A惊讶}这是！"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 2140951457
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951458_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "原来我不见的茶具，是<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>……\n{A大笑}谢谢~咳嚯！我完全没想到它还能修复如初，\n这套茶具现在于我而言，更加意义非凡了。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951458_content",
                "value": "原来我不见的茶具，是<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>……\n{A大笑}谢谢~咳嚯！我完全没想到它还能修复如初，\n这套茶具现在于我而言，更加意义非凡了。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 2140951458
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951459_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "{A想象}这茶具是我朋友的妈妈的表姑奶奶……\n教他烧制的。当时在迁风社，\n我们每次探索任务，他都带着这套茶具。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951459_content",
                "value": "{A想象}这茶具是我朋友的妈妈的表姑奶奶……\n教他烧制的。当时在迁风社，\n我们每次探索任务，他都带着这套茶具。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 2140951459
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951460_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "山塌了我也得跟着他先喝杯茶再跑咳嚯！\n让我赶紧退休，享受生活。\n<style=SizeSmall>他是我在迁风社的第一个队友……</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951460_content",
                "value": "山塌了我也得跟着他先喝杯茶再跑咳嚯！\n让我赶紧退休，享受生活。\n<style=SizeSmall>他是我在迁风社的第一个队友……</style>"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 2140951460
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951461_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "{A抱歉}啊，真是不好意思，\n拿到你帮我修好的茶具，一高兴就扯远了，\n我这就去煮一壶新茶！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951461_content",
                "value": "{A抱歉}啊，真是不好意思，\n拿到你帮我修好的茶具，一高兴就扯远了，\n我这就去煮一壶新茶！"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 2140951461
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
