                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951462_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "庆祝咳嚯……大病初愈，失而复得。\n<style=SizeSmall>一天没喝茶鼻子有点痒……</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502501_2140951462_content",
                "value": "庆祝咳嚯……大病初愈，失而复得。\n<style=SizeSmall>一天没喝茶鼻子有点痒……</style>"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
